framework DecisionAudit

domain PlanReviewAcceptance:
  description "PLAN_REVIEW_ACCEPTANCE cross-surface conformance verification"

problem P1:
  "Verify every accepted Plan Review behavior through source and isolated installed package without conflating technical evidence and owner acceptance"

step S1:
  premise PR1:
    "The user explicitly selects PLAN_REVIEW_ACCEPTANCE; accepted spec section 13 has seventeen mandatory groups and the task requires Core, CLI, schemas, history, races, link and isolated package evidence"

step S2:
  evidence EV1:
    "The existing public task is done; latest source passed 1396 tests and all repository gates; current changes belong to this branch and no remote write or owner acceptance was performed"
    resource:
      file "docs/process/plan-review-public-byte-limit-review-2026-09-30.md"
      label "Current verified implementation baseline"

step S3:
  evidence EV2:
    "Existing tests cover source, mutation, lifecycle, public schemas and advance, but the package gate does not execute a complete Plan Review workflow"
    resource:
      file "scripts/check-package.sh"
      label "Existing installed-package gate"

step S4:
  premise PR2:
    "A test matrix alone would not prove the capability; unsupported or uncovered obligations must remain open"

step S5:
  decision D1 based_on P1, PR1, PR2, EV1, EV2:
    "Create eighteen executable trace rows by splitting normative group 15 into limits/untrusted input and race/no-partial-write; preserve all seventeen mandatory groups. Reuse existing evidence and add public API/CLI acceptance tests for uncovered combinations, running the same public tests against the isolated installed package"

step S6:
  decision D2 based_on PR1, PR2, D1:
    "Use one read-only coverage reviewer; keep scope decisions, writes, integration and shared PERT state with the main agent. Verify source and target bytes for real output races in disposable directories"

step S7:
  pending PD1:
    "Owner acceptance, milestone criteria/receipts, outcomes, canonical advance, commit, push, PR, release and Issue changes remain separate. Mark technical task done only after its exact evidence exists and a status-only digest-bound preview authorizes the write"

step S8:
  premise PR3:
    "The updated user instructions require immediate observed-work measurement when velocity is unusable and prohibit invented actuals"

step S9:
  evidence EV3:
    "project observe-velocity reports incomplete unsupported_source_version evidence for this retained Grammar 9 plan; no usable measured velocity has been established"

step S10:
  decision D3 based_on PR3, EV3, D1:
    "Start measuring the remaining authorized acceptance interval now through a task-start preview with an observed timestamp and distinct event ID; apply only if scope-free and authorized, then record actual completion and reobserve. Preserve the unsupported-source observation as a limitation without expanding implementation scope"

step S11:
  evidence EV4:
    "A valid milestone-acceptance source becomes invalid when the real batch removes its referenced milestone; liftMilestoneAcceptanceCandidate throws a generic Error with the parser diagnostics discarded, and Plan Review composition has no typed domain-failure translation"
    resource:
      file "src/application/contract8-milestone-acceptance.ts"
      label "Observed candidate-validation throw"
    resource:
      file "src/application/plan-review-mutation.ts"
      label "Application composition seam"

step S12:
  premise PR4:
    "Section 10 requires domain failures to exit 1 without candidate or write, while genuine internal invariant failures remain exit 70; existing Grammar 1 through 9 meanings must remain unchanged"

step S13:
  premise PR5:
    "A broad exception catch would conceal unrelated internal errors; lower-candidate parser rejection is independently observable and can be distinguished from unexpected exceptions"

step S14:
  decision D4 based_on EV4, PR4, PR5:
    "The producing condition for this Plan Review failure is treating an expected lower candidate-validation rejection as an untyped invariant exception at the adapter seam. Detection coverage previously used an injected guard rather than this real milestone-removal input. Other exception-producing paths remain unproven"

step S15:
  decision D5 based_on D4, PR4, PR5, D1:
    "Carry existing parser diagnostics in a private typed Error retaining the existing lower throw message; only Plan Review resolution translates that exact class to a failed composed result and PTREV-109. Rethrow unexpected errors. Verify a real public API and CLI rejection plus legacy failure behavior; retain unchanged owner and persistence gates"

step S16:
  evidence EV5:
    "Independent final review and direct inspection show that section 4 requires the complete review projection before recommendation in both dag next text and JSON; current text omits clear state and JSON appends the projection after recommendation"
    resource:
      file "src/cli.ts"
      label "Observed Next presentation order"

step S17:
  decision D6 based_on EV5, PR1, PR2:
    "Emit every projection field before recommendation in text for clear and review_required states, and position the JSON plan_review property before recommendation. Preserve all recommendation semantics, add both-state text and raw JSON order assertions to PRAC-017, rebuild and rerun relevant and complete gates"

step S18:
  evidence EV6:
    "The post-presentation full run failed the old recommendation text golden because the required additive projection is now present; an unchanged MCP stdio discovery test also timed out. The latter producing condition is unknown"

step S19:
  decision D7 based_on EV6, D6, PR2:
    "Validate the added projection against JSON and compare the remaining operational text byte-for-byte with the historical golden. Preserve the golden. Run the unchanged MCP suite alone and the complete suite with concurrency four; do not infer or fix an unproved MCP cause or relax its timeout"

step S20:
  evidence EV7:
    "Final corrected source passes 1421 tests and every repository gate; isolated package passes 26 cases. The task finish is scope-free and applied with digest protection. Next is empty and both makespans are zero; milestone acceptance remains not_declared and velocity history remains unsupported"

step S21:
  pending PD2:
    "Whole-task measured velocity and independent person effort are unavailable. The 39-minute-eight-second interval covers only remaining work. Owner waiting and future release scope have no bounded calendar assumption"

step S22:
  pending A1:
    "Close the authorized technical task and ask the owner to select any subsequent durable acceptance or release work from this exact record"
  pending A2:
    "Extend this task into history correction or assurance acceptance without an owner-selected exact scope"

step S23:
  decision D8 based_on EV7, PD1, PD2, A1, A2:
    "Close technical work at zero remaining effort. Recommend owner review of the record; any owner-selected acceptance record or criterion/receipt candidate is provisionally 0.2-0.5 agent-hours low confidence. Keep the separate unsupported-source investigation candidate at 0.5-1.5 agent-hours low confidence, with current-validator replay and a fully measured task as verification checkpoints. Do not execute either extension or adopt partial-task velocity"
